    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 16, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "总之得先从调查现场开始。<br>\n艾玛首先调查了一下审判庭内发现尸体的现场。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 18, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（……亚里沙……）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "少女被捆绑在椅子上，无力地垂着脑袋。<br>\n那个模样实在过于凄惨。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "以平常的心态根本不忍直视，<br>\n但为了找出证据和线索，艾玛唯有狠下心来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "有人对亚里沙小姐进行了处刑吗……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Meruru001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哭红了眼睛的梅露露<br>\n跌跌撞撞地来到艾玛身边。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看来她已经调整好了心情，打算帮助艾玛调查。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（处刑……最让人在意的还是这一点）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这个是电椅，对吧。<br>\n用来执行电刑，令犯人触电致死。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "应、应该没错……<br>\n椅背上也有按钮……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Meruru002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "如梅露露所说，<br>\n椅背上设置有一个按钮。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然不清楚具体是什么构造，<br>\n但应该是按一下就会通电的那种。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙的头发和衣服都是湿的……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（这是为什么……？）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "以我们的条件<br>\n没法特定亚里沙的死因。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，电椅触电应该就是她的死因吧……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema007"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_28", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Params": ["4-2"]}},
    {"op": "UpdateWitchBook", "line": 56, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "4-2", "Category": "Clue", "Version": 1}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛小姐，你看……！", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Meruru003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "梅露露正指着一道<br>\n留在亚里沙脸上的痕迹。<br>\n艾玛吞了吞口水。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这……是灼伤？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "而且……看样子她的魔女化程度已经很深了。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Meruru004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 67, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙的外表可以说已经面目全非，<br>\n完全不像普通人类了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 69, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（简直……就像残骸一样）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema009"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_28", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 77, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Params": ["4-9"]}},
    {"op": "UpdateWitchBook", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "4-9", "Category": "Clue", "Version": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "i1.5"}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Wait": 1, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 82, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在调查处刑台的地板时，<br>\n艾玛还发现了一件事。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 84, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "以尸体的双脚为中心，<br>\n附近一大片的地面上都散落着玻璃碎片状的东西。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_28", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 92, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Params": ["4-5"]}},
    {"op": "UpdateWitchBook", "line": 93, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "4-5", "Category": "Clue", "Version": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 94, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "i1.5"}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 95, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Wait": 1, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 97, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（这到底是什么东西……？）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 99, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这看起来不像是电椅上的玻璃装饰或零件，<br>\n更像是从别的什么地方拿过来的。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，再怎么想也无法当场得出答案。<br>\n艾玛把憋在胸口的闷气都吐了出来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 103, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "接着她往下移动视线，然后，在亚里沙的脚边发现了<br>\n一片混在玻璃碎片里的透明碎片。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这……是蜡……吗？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊啊，这个是……<br>\n用过的蜡烛残片……吧？", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Meruru005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（……是亚里沙用过的东西吗？）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema012"]}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 114, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Params": ["4-1"]}},
    {"op": "UpdateWitchBook", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "4-1", "Category": "Clue", "Version": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 116, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "i1.5"}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Wait": 1, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（亚里沙的周围<br>\n　我都已经看了一遍）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（为什么<br>\n　亚里沙会在处刑台……？）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema014"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 124, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_28", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Params": ["4-8"]}},
    {"op": "UpdateWitchBook", "line": 130, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "4-8", "Category": "Clue", "Version": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "i1.5"}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 132, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Wait": 1, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 134, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛对处刑台的底座部分有些在意，<br>\n于是用手机拍了一张照片。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 136, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（……至今我们已经目击过好几次处刑）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 138, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（每次处刑时，这个底座会下降到地下，<br>\n　然后又升上来另一个不同的处刑台）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema016"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 140, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（虽然不太清楚具体构造，<br>\n　但这应该都是靠机械运作的吧）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema017"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 142, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "想起处刑时那阵齿轮互相碰撞的刺耳声音，<br>\n艾玛用力地甩了甩头。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative016"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 144, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她再次看向亚里沙的模样，<br>\n泪水随即模糊了视野。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative017"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 146, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（如果真的有人害亚里沙遭到这种不幸，<br>\n　我绝对不会原谅这个人）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema018"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 148, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛小姐，你还好吗……？", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Meruru006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 150, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "梅露露轻轻地把手搭在艾玛的肩膀上，<br>\n于是艾玛用袖口用力地擦了擦眼泪。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative018"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 152, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我没事。我去其他地方调查。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema019"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 154, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "好的……请你千万不要勉强自己。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Meruru007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 156, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯，梅露露，谢谢你。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Ema020"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 158, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛走出了审判庭。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Adv09_Narrative019"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 165, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
